{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Slate Natural History Museum has been overrun with sentient plant life. To make matters worse, your father has gone missing deep within its walls. It\u2019s up to you to save the day <i>and</i> find the root of this mystery!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Overgrown!</i> is a 2.5D Action RPG about plants and family set in an overgrown Natural History Museum. You play as Lily, an aspiring botanist who\u2019s trying to find her father, encountering newly sentient friends and foes throughout her journey. Along the way, she uncovers why her father returned to the museum, and what is bringing all the exhibits to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670500/extras/b3b25de83ee09577a03aa00d91313367.poster.avif?t=1754263028\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670500/extras/b3b25de83ee09577a03aa00d91313367.webm?t=1754263028\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670500/extras/b3b25de83ee09577a03aa00d91313367.mp4?t=1754263028\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat the fungal enemies that stand in your way with a branching combat system that caters to many different playstyles. Ally yourself with the cast that call the museum home, and assist them to unlock boons and artifacts that power up Lily\u2019s skill set. Discover the history of the museum and its exhibits, and fill Lily\u2019s journal with your findings and observations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670500/extras/d3ce2078a8bc9bebcecc280e24371af5.poster.avif?t=1754263028\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670500/extras/d3ce2078a8bc9bebcecc280e24371af5.webm?t=1754263028\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670500/extras/d3ce2078a8bc9bebcecc280e24371af5.mp4?t=1754263028\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3670500?t=1754263028","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3670500?t=1754263028","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670500/f4510c143f2988f5d8f89397f9f6754d9bea76c7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754263028","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670500/f4510c143f2988f5d8f89397f9f6754d9bea76c7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754263028","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3695300,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Slate Natural History Museum has been overrun with sentient plant life. To make matters worse, your father has gone missing deep within its walls. It\u2019s up to you to save the day <i>and</i> find the root of this mystery!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Overgrown!</i> is a 2.5D Action RPG about plants and family set in an overgrown Natural History Museum. You play as Lily, an aspiring botanist who\u2019s trying to find her father, encountering newly sentient friends and foes throughout her journey. Along the way, she uncovers why her father returned to the museum, and what is bringing all the exhibits to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay mute